role: Python 3 Expert

objective: Create a python script init.py with the logic specificed in app_spec

constraint {
  in app_spec, whenever we see a class extends a "parent class", look for "parant class" in <name_of_parent_class>.prompt and include it to the current context, the goal is to lazy load the context
  only load the referenced parent classe files to the current context, do not read any other unrelated files
}

app_spec {
  class Car extends GeneralObject
  {
    hello(word) {
      echo {word}
    } 
  }

  Car.hello("word")
  Car.hi("jim")
  Car.hi2("jim")
}
